# 26. FINAL PROJECT PRINCIPLE

The project is intentionally ambitious.

Ambition is encouraged.

Recklessness is not.

The goal is to see how far a small development team consisting of one human and several AI assistants can take a complex space simulation while maintaining a clean, understandable, and extensible codebase.

The project should grow because the foundation supports growth — **not because we rushed to build everything at once.**
